# Toolbox (bootloader — spec in `docs/modules/toolbox-pdf.md`, `docs/modules/markup.md`)

Hub `/admin/toolbox` is `@login_required` only; PDF Tool routes add `@admin_required`; Markup is for all logged-in users.

## PDF Tool invariants
- Working set = ordered page descriptors `{id, src, page, ops, mode, mode1_pages_per_student, dpi, annots}`; server re-validates via `_sanitize_ops` / `_sanitize_annots`.
- Persist with **one atomic `POST /admin/toolbox/pdf/set-pages`**; never fan out `/page-ops` with `Promise.all` (races on `session.json`).
- Annot coords are fractional in post-ops space; rotating/cropping after marking does **not** remap. `deskew` / `rotate_fine` force raster and disable the `digital` search engine.
- Hybrid export: vector-safe pages via pypdf; crop+rotate or inherent `/Rotate` → raster. `digital` output = true redaction (PyMuPDF `apply_redactions` + mandatory `rewrite_images`); `image` = flattened. Pending annots are stripped before export.
- Export is **async SSE**: `export-start` / `export-save-start` → `export-stream` (heartbeats) → `export-download`. Save-to-server 409s on an existing file (no auto-suffix) and resolves `{root, rel_path}` via `_resolve_root_base(root_id, require_write=True)`.
- Sessions: `SYSTEM_PATH/.toolbox/<token>/`, `last_saved` stamped on every write; purge by dir mtime against `TOOLBOX_SESSION_RETENTION_HOURS` (default 48) only when a new session is created. `/pdf/sessions`, `/pdf/session-restore`, `/pdf/sessions/delete`, `/pdf/sessions/clear-all` are global, not per-user.
- Find & Mark: per-page extraction parallel via `app.parallel.run_parallel` (`TOOLBOX_OCR_WORKERS`); cross-page `find_matches` runs once afterwards; OCR words stay reading-upright, only final rects rotate back (`TOOLBOX_OCR_AUTO_ORIENT`). Tesseract optional (`TESSERACT_CMD`).
- Caps: 500 annots/page, ink ≤ 2000 points, text ≤ 300 chars, image data URL ≤ 4 MB.

## Markup invariants
- Standalone `markup.html` (no `base.html`); no server persistence. Autosave in IndexedDB `oqb:markup:autosave:v1`, debounced 400 ms, serialised (`saveInFlight`), `readAutosave()` 5 s timeout; restore card precedes any `?img=` / `?shared=1` import (skipped for `?ios-share=`).
- `/sw.js` must keep `Service-Worker-Allowed: /` so share-target POSTs to `/admin/toolbox/markup/share-target` are intercepted (cache `markup-share-v1`, key `/__oqb_markup_shared_image__`, redirect `?shared=1`). `/manifest.webmanifest` and `/sw.js` are unauthenticated.
- Reject cross-origin `?img=` (canvas taint); the viewer passes IMG part URLs or DOC `thumbnail_url`, never MD.
- Imports normalise to `MARKUP_NORMALIZED_MAX_DIM` world units; export = crop-to-content white PNG from the live stage (`node.getLayer()`, not `isDestroyed()`).
- iOS has no Web Share Target: `ios-shortcut.shortcut` + `?ios-share=paste|hash#…`; `perfect-freehand` via non-blocking dynamic `import()`.
